      "id": "PR_kwDOL-xLQ88AAAABKYCNWA",
      "title": "security: Update dependency serialize-javascript to v7.1.3 [SECURITY]",
      "author": "oplabs-renovate",
      "number": 785,
      "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Change | [Age](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) | [Confidence](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [serialize-javascript](https://redirect.github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript) | [`7.0.5` → `7.1.3`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/serialize-javascript/7.0.5/7.1.3) | ![age](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/age/npm/serialize-javascript/7.1.3?slim=true) | ![confidence](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/confidence/npm/serialize-javascript/7.0.5/7.1.3?slim=true) |\n\n---\n\n### Serialize JavaScript: Cross-site scripting (XSS) via unescaped </script at the end of a serialized function body\n[CVE-2026-115897](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-115897) / [GHSA-m5mm-p8h7-m29v](https://redirect.github.com/advisories/GHSA-m5mm-p8h7-m29v)\n\n<details>\n<summary>More information</summary>\n\n#### Details\n##### Impact\n\n`serialize-javascript` escapes its output so it is safe to embed inside a\n`<script>` element. Before 7.1.3 that guarantee did not hold for a **function\nvalue whose source ends in a bare `</script`**.\n\nEach function body is escaped on its own, and a bare `</script` was only\nneutralized when followed — within the same body — by a character the HTML\ntokenizer treats as ending the tag name (TAB, LF, FF, CR, SPACE, `/` or `>`).\nA body ending exactly at `</script` has no following character, so it was\nemitted unescaped. The delimiter is then supplied by the surrounding output\n(for example the newline the `space` option emits after the value), and a\nlater serialized value can supply the closing `>` followed by markup:\n\n```js\nconst serialize = require('serialize-javascript');\nfunction f() {} f.toString = () => 'function f(){ return 1 }//</script';\nfunction g() {} g.toString = () => 'function g(x){ return x } > <img src=x onerror=alert(1)>';\nserialize({ a: { f }, g }, { space: 2 });\n// {\n//   \"a\": {\n//     \"f\": function f(){ return 1 }//</script\n//   },\n//   \"g\": function g(x){ return x } > <img src=x onerror=alert(1)>\n// }\n```\n\nEmbedded in a `<script>` element, the script ends at the injected tag and the\n`<img>` becomes a live element in the page.\n\nExploitation requires an attacker to control the **source text** of a\nserialized function, in practice through a spoofed `toString()`. Real\nfunctions always end in `}`, so ordinary function values are not affected,\nand non-function values (including strings containing `</script`) are\nescaped correctly.\n\n##### Patches\n\nFixed in **7.1.3** (#&#8203;235). The bare `</script` form is now also matched at\nthe end of the function body, so it is escaped regardless of what follows it\nin the output.\n\n##### Workarounds\n\nUpgrade to **7.1.3**. If you cannot upgrade, do not serialize function values\nwhose source text (or `toString()`) can be influenced by an attacker.\n\n##### Credits\n\nReported by **ha_kr25** via the Yahoo bug bounty program.\n\n#### Severity\n- CVSS Score: 2.1 / 10 (Low)\n- Vector String: `CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:H/AT:P/PR:L/UI:P/VC:L/VI:L/VA:N/SC:L/SI:L/SA:N`\n\n#### References\n- [https://github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/security/advisories/GHSA-m5mm-p8h7-m29v](https://redirect.github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/security/advisories/GHSA-m5mm-p8h7-m29v)\n- [https://github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/pull/235](https://redirect.github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/pull/235)\n- [https://github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/commit/2864b3c6260a3bfd52d2db3e70d1a079de108a61](https://redirect.github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/commit/2864b3c6260a3bfd52d2db3e70d1a079de108a61)\n- [https://github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript](https://redirect.github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript)\n- [https://github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/releases/tag/v7.1.3](https://redirect.github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/releases/tag/v7.1.3)\n\nThis data is provided by [OSV](https://osv.dev/vulnerability/GHSA-m5mm-p8h7-m29v) and the [GitHub Advisory Database](https://redirect.github.com/github/advisory-database) ([CC-BY 4.0](https://redirect.github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/main/LICENSE.md)).\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>yahoo/serialize-javascript (serialize-javascript)</summary>\n\n### [`v7.1.3`](https://redirect.github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/releases/tag/v7.1.3)\n\n[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/compare/v7.1.2...v7.1.3)\n\nSee: <https://github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/security/advisories/GHSA-m5mm-p8h7-m29v>\n\n#### What's Changed\n\n- fix: escape `</script` at the end of a serialized function body by [@&#8203;redonkulus](https://redirect.github.com/redonkulus) in [#&#8203;235](https://redirect.github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/pull/235)\n- Fix serialization of Dates with expanded ISO years by [@&#8203;Shubham-Padkonde](https://redirect.github.com/Shubham-Padkonde) in [#&#8203;232](https://redirect.github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/pull/232)\n- fix: ignore functions without mutating input objects by [@&#8203;Shubham-Padkonde](https://redirect.github.com/Shubham-Padkonde) in [#&#8203;233](https://redirect.github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/pull/233)\n- release: v7.1.3 by [@&#8203;redonkulus](https://redirect.github.com/redonkulus) in [#&#8203;236](https://redirect.github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/pull/236)\n\n##### Note on `ignoreFunction`\n\nWith `ignoreFunction: true`, function values are now omitted the same way `JSON.stringify` omits them, without deleting them from the input object. Functions inside arrays are emitted as `null` (previously this produced `Array.prototype.slice.call(...)` output).\n\n#### New Contributors\n\n- [@&#8203;Shubham-Padkonde](https://redirect.github.com/Shubham-Padkonde) made their first contribution in [#&#8203;232](https://redirect.github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/pull/232)\n\n**Full Changelog**: <https://github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/compare/v7.1.2...v7.1.3>\n\n### [`v7.1.2`](https://redirect.github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/releases/tag/v7.1.2)\n\n[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/compare/v7.1.1...v7.1.2)\n\nSee: <https://github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/security/advisories/GHSA-gfhx-hw2g-v5hg>\n\n### [`v7.1.1`](https://redirect.github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/releases/tag/v7.1.1)\n\n[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/compare/v7.1.0...v7.1.1)\n\n#### What's Changed\n\n- fix: fix XSS bypass via split `</script` payload across function bodies by [@&#8203;okuryu](https://redirect.github.com/okuryu) in [#&#8203;226](https://redirect.github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/pull/226)\n- release: v7.1.1 by [@&#8203;okuryu](https://redirect.github.com/okuryu) in [#&#8203;227](https://redirect.github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/pull/227)\n\n**Full Changelog**: <https://github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/compare/v7.1.0...v7.1.1>\n\n### [`v7.1.0`](https://redirect.github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/releases/tag/v7.1.0)\n\n[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/compare/v7.0.7...v7.1.0)\n\n#### What's Changed\n\n- feat: add Node.js 26 to test matrix by [@&#8203;okuryu](https://redirect.github.com/okuryu) in [#&#8203;224](https://redirect.github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/pull/224)\n- release: v7.1.0 by [@&#8203;okuryu](https://redirect.github.com/okuryu) in [#&#8203;225](https://redirect.github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/pull/225)\n\n**Full Changelog**: <https://github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/compare/v7.0.7...v7.1.0>\n\n### [`v7.0.7`](https://redirect.github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/releases/tag/v7.0.7)\n\n[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/compare/v7.0.6...v7.0.7)\n\n#### What's Changed\n\n- fix: reject spoofed RegExp objects with non-string source property by [@&#8203;redonkulus](https://redirect.github.com/redonkulus) in [#&#8203;222](https://redirect.github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/pull/222)\n- release: v7.0.7 by [@&#8203;okuryu](https://redirect.github.com/okuryu) in [#&#8203;223](https://redirect.github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/pull/223)\n\n**Full Changelog**: <https://github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/compare/v7.0.6...v7.0.7>\n\n### [`v7.0.6`](https://redirect.github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/releases/tag/v7.0.6)\n\n[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/compare/v7.0.5...v7.0.6)\n\n#### What's Changed\n\n- build(deps-dev): bump lodash from 4.17.23 to 4.18.1 by [@&#8203;dependabot](https://redirect.github.com/dependabot)\\[bot] in [#&#8203;215](https://redirect.github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/pull/215)\n- fix: reject spoofed URL objects with non-string toString() result by [@&#8203;redonkulus](https://redirect.github.com/redonkulus) in [#&#8203;217](https://redirect.github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/pull/217)\n- release: v7.0.6 by [@&#8203;okuryu](https://redirect.github.com/okuryu) in [#&#8203;221](https://redirect.github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/pull/221)\n\n**Full Changelog**: <https://github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/compare/v7.0.5...v7.0.6>\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: (UTC)\n\n- Branch creation\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n- Automerge\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is behind base branch, or you tick the rebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Mend Renovate](https://redirect.github.com/renovatebot/renovate).\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0My4yODguMCIsInVwZGF0ZWRJblZlciI6IjQzLjI4OC4wIiwidGFyZ2V0QnJhbmNoIjoibWFpbiIsImxhYmVscyI6WyJyZW5vdmF0ZS1jdmUiLCJzZWN1cml0eSJd